\b scale\

\fs14 \

\pard\tx3600\tx3980\tx4340\b0\fs28\li1500\fc0\cf0 Limits the precision of the values returned by NSDecimalNumber's 
\b decimalNumberBy...
\b0  methods. \

\fs14 \

\fs28 Specifically, 
\b scale
\b0  returns the number of digits allowed after the decimal separator. If 
\b scale
\b0  returns a negative value, it affects the digits 
\i before
\i0  the decimal separator as well. If 
\b scale
\b0  returns NSDecimalNoScale, the number of digits is unlimited.\

\fs14 \

